    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ nan man nan ðing ne bycge ofer feower peninga weorð, ne libbende ne licgende, buton mon habbe getreowe gewitnysse feower manna, sy hit binnan byrig, sy hit up on lande.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no-one shall buy anything over four pence in value, either livestock or other property, unless he have four men as trustworthy witnesses, whether [the purchase be made] within a town or in the open country.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ nan man nan þingc ne bigce ofer feower peniwurð, ne libbende ne licgende, butan man hæbbe getrywe gewitnesse feower manna, seo hit binnan byrig, sy hit upp on lande.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
